{{- /*
The name of the method a sibling role field calls, as a literal.

For a law an interface registers once per method under one row: the
identifier and the claim belong to the law, so the method is the only
thing left that can tell one probe from another in a failure.
*/ -}}
{{- define "model.lawfield.MethodName" -}}
{{ .Name }}: {{ printf "%q" .Method }}
{{- end -}}
